  "song": {
    "meta": {
      "title": "Paper Satellites",
      "author": "Ady & Claude",
      "description": "Original soul-ballad / synth-funk instrumental. One tempo, two clocks: half-time 6/8 triplets for the emotional passages, swung sixteenths for the funk. The Ab-Db-C-Ab-Bb cell is sung by a cello in D-flat major and chopped by a talk-box lead in B-flat minor Dorian; the finale layers both, then lifts a half step. 124 BPM, 99 bars."
    },
